You're right.

73
00:04:47,645 --> 00:04:49,125
On s'est rencontrés il y a vingt ans.
We met twenty years ago.

74
00:04:49,205 --> 00:04:51,685
Sur un tournage. C'était juste après Nulle Part Ailleurs.
On a movie set.
It was right after Nulle Part Ailleurs.

75
00:04:51,765 --> 00:04:53,685
Elle débutait, moi aussi…
She was starting out, so was I…

76
00:04:53,765 --> 00:04:57,765
Elle venait de se marier, moi aussi. Et… Voilà…
She'd just gotten married
