97
00:05:57,605 --> 00:05:59,805
Qu'on allait se mettre mutuellement en danger.
That we were going to put
each other at risk.

98
00:06:01,245 --> 00:06:04,405
Et qu'on allait faire beaucoup de mal à beaucoup de gens.
And that we were going to hurt
a great many people.

99
00:06:07,725 --> 00:06:08,765
Alors je suis parti.
So I left.

100
00:06:11,645 --> 00:06:13,685
Et on n'a plus jamais repris contact.
And we never got in touch again.

101
00:06:15,085 --> 00:06:16,765
