No. I did what had to be done.

105
00:06:23,165 --> 00:06:25,645
-Tu crois pas qu'elle s'en est remise ? -Sûrement.
-Don't you think she got over it?
-She probably did.

106
00:06:25,725 --> 00:06:27,445
