-I mean, twenty years…
-Yeah.

107
00:06:28,325 --> 00:06:29,645
Tu l'as vue, elle est belle.
You saw her, she's beautiful.

108
00:06:31,325 --> 00:06:32,165
Ouais…
Yeah…

