It's her dream.

148
00:08:38,525 --> 00:08:39,684
Parfait.
Sounds great.

149
00:08:41,125 --> 00:08:43,924
-C'était qui ? -Honoré a choisi une de mes actrices !
-Who was it?
-Honoré picked one of my actresses!

150
00:08:44,005 --> 00:08:45,605
Un petit rôle, mais c'est génial.
A small part but this is awesome.

151
00:08:45,684 --> 00:08:47,405
-Super. -Il faut que je l'appelle.
-Cool.
-I've got to call her.

152
00:08:48,525 --> 00:08:49,685
Ça va être une belle journée.
It will be a great day.

153
00:08:50,805 --> 00:08:51,645
Ouais.
Yeah.

154
00:08:54,005 --> 00:08:56,285
Oui, je sais que c'est impoli, Constance.
Yes, I know it's rude, Constance.

