and suffering into her performance.

160
00:09:09,805 --> 00:09:12,285
Ce sera poignant, tu ne le regretteras pas !
It'll be poignant, you won't regret it!

161
00:09:14,005 --> 00:09:16,205
Oui ? Oh, merci !
Yes? Oh, thank you!

162
