163
00:09:18,325 --> 00:09:20,365
Très bien, super. Écoute…
All right, great. Listen…

164
00:09:20,445 --> 00:09:22,365
Elle va être aux anges. Merci.
She's going to be over the moon. Thanks.

165
00:09:22,885 --> 00:09:24,885
-Merde. -Pourquoi "merde" ?
-Shit.
-Why "shit"?

166
00:09:25,365 --> 00:09:26,405
C'est pas une bonne nouvelle ?
Isn't it great news?

167
00:09:26,485 --> 00:09:30,325
Maintenant il faut que je la convainque. Tu ne la connais pas, c'est un chat. Un siamois.
Now I have to convince her. You don't
know her, she's a cat. A Siamese cat.

168
00:09:30,405 --> 00:09:32,365
Fascinant mais imprévisible.
Fascinating but unpredictable.

169
00:09:33,565 --> 00:09:36,165
On ne sait jamais si elle va ronronner ou te déchirer le visage.
You never know if she's going to purr
or rip up your face.

170
00:09:36,245 --> 00:09:37,605
Valérie Donzelli.
Valérie Donzelli.

171
00:09:37,685 --> 00:09:39,445
La gamine doit trembler de joie.
The kid must be quivering with joy.

172
00:09:39,525 --> 00:09:42,805
Ça lui fait peur, oui. Et elle ne m'écoute pas.
It's making her freak out is what it is.
